  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Expertst&#xf6;d upphandling</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Mustam&#xe4;e ToR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional decision on expert support concerning the Mustam&#xe4;e-project in Estonia, which aim is to elaborate a plan for development at the Mustam&#xe4;e hospital in Tallinn and to carry out a training programme on modern health care and technical- and functional planning. Swedish counterpart is Aff&#xe4;rsConcept. Total Sida contribution: 25 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats g&#xe4;ller till&#xe4;ggsbeslut om expertst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r upphandling ang utvecklingsprojektet f&#xf6;r Mustam&#xe4;e sjukhus i Tallinn, Estland. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att utarbeta en plan f&#xf6;r omvandling av sjukhuset samt att genom- f&#xf6;ra utbildning i modern h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd, teknisk- och funktionell planering. Svensk part &#xe4;r Aff&#xe4;rsConcept. Totalt st&#xf6;d 2000: 25 000 SEK</narrative>
  </description>
